r); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">License</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">Freeware</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Base URL</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Login URL</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/login.php</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Register URL</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/register.php</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Forgot URL</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/forgot.php</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Website</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Description</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">Chataropica: Chat everyday with friends and families, artists, business and loved ones, Connect with the world</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Brand Colors</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">#0052FF brandblue, #FFD60A brandyellow</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Theme</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">Day and Night toggle with localStorage chataropica_theme</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); width: 113.109375px;\">Manifest</th><td style=\"border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px;\">https://aedtpworld.com/chat/manifest.json</td></tr></tbody></table></a></div></div><article class=\"awfl-article\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: sans-serif; caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><p><strong>CHATAROPICA</strong>&nbsp;is an instant messaging application developed by&nbsp;<strong>AEDTP WORLD</strong>. The software is primarily distributed as an application for Android and Windows, with additional access provided via a web interface, comparable to the distribution model of Facebook.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Overview</h2><p><strong>CHATAROPICA</strong>&nbsp;allows users to chat everyday with friends and families, artists, business and loved ones. It connects users with the world. User accounts are categorized as personal, business, or artist.</p><p>Messaging is initiated through username-based URLs in the format&nbsp;<a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/index.php?with=username\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Chat With Username</a>.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Interface</h2><p>The Chats interface is accessible only to logged-in users. The header contains the Chataropica logo and a count of users currently online.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Features</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li>One-to-one direct messaging</li><li>Inline text formatting including bold, italics, strikethrough, and lists</li><li>Automatic hyperlinking of https URLs</li><li>@username mentions that link to user profiles</li><li>Verification badges: green for personal, black for business, blue for artist</li><li>Day and night themes</li><li>Avatar images set via external URLs; file uploads are not supported</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Login Page</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li><strong>Title</strong>&nbsp;— Log In - Chataropica</li><li><strong>Header Logo</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;<img src=\"https://aedtpworld.com/icons/chataropica.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 250px !important;\">&nbsp;— 100x100 rounded-2xl</li><li><strong>Heading</strong>&nbsp;— Chataropica — text-brandblue dark:text-brandyellow</li><li><strong>Subheading</strong>&nbsp;— Welcome back</li><li><strong>Form Method</strong>&nbsp;— POST</li><li><strong>Form Action</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;<a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/login.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Login Action</a></li><li><strong>CSRF Token</strong>&nbsp;— Hidden input name csrf</li><li><strong>Username Field</strong>&nbsp;— name username, required, autofocus</li><li><strong>Password Field</strong>&nbsp;— name password, required</li><li><strong>Submit Button</strong>&nbsp;— Log In — bg-brandblue dark:bg-brandyellow</li><li><strong>Links</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;<a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/forgot.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Forgot password</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/register.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Sign up</a></li><li><strong>Footer</strong>&nbsp;— Chataropica • © AEDTP WORLD</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Technical Details</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li><strong>Tailwind Config</strong>&nbsp;— darkMode class, colors brandblue #0052FF, brandyellow #FFD60A</li><li><strong>Theme Script</strong>&nbsp;— Reads localStorage chataropica_theme default day, if night adds dark class to documentElement</li><li><strong>Toggle Button</strong>&nbsp;— Fixed top-4 right-4 text-2xl, themeIcon 🌙, onclick toggleTheme()</li><li><strong>Assets</strong>&nbsp;— /root/css/ads.css, /chat/assets/app.js</li><li><strong>Classes</strong>&nbsp;— app-transition bg-white dark:bg-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col</li><li><strong>Input Style</strong>&nbsp;— w-full border rounded-lg p-2 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brandblue</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">SEO and Meta</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li><strong>Description</strong>&nbsp;— Chataropica: Chat everyday with friends and families, artists, business and loved ones, Connect with the world</li><li><strong>OG Site Name</strong>&nbsp;— Chataropica</li><li><strong>OG Title</strong>&nbsp;— Chataropica</li><li><strong>OG Image</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;<img src=\"https://aedtpworld.com/icons/chataropica.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 250px !important;\"></li><li><strong>Twitter Card</strong>&nbsp;— summary</li><li><strong>Icon</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;<img src=\"https://aedtpworld.com/icons/chataropica.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 250px !important;\"></li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">External Links</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Chataropica Official</a></li><li><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/login.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Log In</a></li><li><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/register.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Sign Up</a></li><li><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/chat/forgot.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Forgot Password</a></li></ul></article>",
